Huawei Ascend RAGSDK compatibility
-----------------------------------
This project is designed to interoperate with Huawei Ascend RAGSDK only when a
user independently provisions a supported external RAGSDK runtime. Huawei
Ascend RAGSDK source code is licensed under Mulan PSL v2. RAGSDK source code is
not included in this project, is not vendored into this distribution, and is
not relicensed by Apache-2.0.

Using RAGSDK is optional and requires the user to obtain and comply with the
applicable upstream software, license, hardware, and service requirements. The
CPU baseline container does not include, install, or claim to validate RAGSDK.
